    "Id": "mechdef_skinwalker_ii_SKW-2-C",
    "Name": "Skinwalker II C",
    "Details": "The C configuration of the Skinwalker II OmniMech is nearly visually identical to the Prime, which lets it surprise enemies that have only faced that configuration. It typically uses its jump jets to get behind its target, then unloads four Medium Pulse Lasers and two SRM-6 launchers into the weaker rear armor. A Nova CEWS takes care of electronic warfare, and its missile bins carry Inferno rounds alongside standard ones.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Skinwalkerii"
  },
